<h3 id=3D"filesearch">FileSearch</h3>
<p>The FileSearch class is responsible for traversing the file system from =
a given File, using a FileSearchCriteria object to select matching files an=
d return them. By separating traversal from filtering logic, the design rem=
ains modular, maintainable, and easy to extend. The UML diagram below illus=
