<h3 id=3D"filesearchcriteria">FileSearchCriteria</h3>
<p>The FileSearchCriteria class decides which files match our search by con=
necting FileSearch to Predicate. It tells FileSearch what qualifies as a ma=
tch, using Predicate to check each File against the conditions.</p>
