ds` and an `isMatch(File)` method; and `NotPredicate`, which has a `Predica=
te operand` and an `isMatch(File)` method.  Dashed lines indicate implement=
ation relationships, showing how the concrete classes implement the interfa=
ces.  Solid lines show inheritance relationships. The diagram shows how sim=
ple predicates can be combined using composite predicates to create more co=
mplex filtering logic." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"624" height=3D"417" decod=
