<p><strong>Alternate implementation:</strong> Instead of using FileSearchCr=
iteria, FileSearch could directly invoke the Predicate's logic to evaluate =
files. However, this would tightly couple traversal and filtering logic, ma=
king it harder to modify or extend conditions independently.</p>
<h3 id=3D"filesearch-1">FileSearch</h3>
<p>The FileSearch class orchestrates the search across the filesystem, star=
ting from a root File and leveraging FileSearchCriteria to identify matchin=
g files through recursive traversal. It employs a stack-based approach to e=
xplore directories efficiently. Here=E2=80=99s the implementation:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-java"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">// Mai=
n class responsible for performing file system searches</span>
